The distinct profile permits 64MiB aggregate bodies, 31MiB getter proof/response/receipt metadata with 1MiB reserved for a failure receipt, and 1MiB coordinator logs/JSON: 96MiB logical writes total. These are refusal caps; 259MiB summed individual ceilings do not promise completion.
